  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a string that is the substring of <b>src</b> from <b>start</b> to <b>end</b>, leaving the original <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/String" target="_blank">string</a> intact.</p>
</p>
